NOTE (2026-10-21): the comparison above refers to the code of 2026-10-05. Afterwards, the Morse
integrals were reworked (FcfMorse0.get_I0n evaluated in logarithms via FcfMorse0._integrals; all
modes above anh_thr get Morse FCFs, no fallback to harmonic FCFs). This changes the anharmonic
results of the example slightly: k_IC anharmonic 1.042e+07 -> 1.038e+07 1/s (-0.4 %), enhancement
factor of the 1681 cm-1 mode (A) 308.290 -> 309.772; the harmonic results are unchanged.
reference_output/ refers to the current code.
